title: Replace `force_enable_webrtc` with `disable_webrtc`
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    This PR changes the default behavior of validators and collators so that the WebRTC endpoint is enabled out of the box, without any extra configuration.

    The goal is for metanodes to start the WebRTC endpoint by default.
crates:
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: patch
- name: sc-cli
  bump: patch
- name: sc-network
  bump: patch
